WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.270
I want you to forgive yours truly!

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:04.950
I said that was enough!

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.690
Get back to work, you...

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.960
You...!

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:25.120
How dare you do something like that to the president?!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.370
Have some shame!

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:38.850
I'll be going back then, Vice President.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:43.480
Do you have any idea what will
happen to you, after doing this?

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.140
Make your peace.

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:48.570
President, please wait!

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:50.880
Are you okay?

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.030
He's still alive, right?

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:55.150
Why would you do
this now, of all times?

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:57.430
This was necessary.

00:00:57.430 --> 00:01:00.720
It's the clincher for our new breakout plan.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:01.660
Huh?

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:07.360
Looks like Gakuto went to
apologize to the vice president.

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:10.240
I wonder just what kind of working over he'll get.

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:11.820
Are you jealous?

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:13.970
As expected of you, Andre.

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:16.210
You're sure about this?

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:18.060
Yes.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.720
I am prepared to accept it.

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:18.990
Gakuto sure is taking a while.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.250
Hey—

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:27.440
What the hell happened to you?!

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:31.020
Yours truly is deeply repentant of today's event,

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:34.770
and so he had the vice
president tonsure his head.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.140
Oh, so it wasn't a working over...

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:39.590
I got her to forgive
me for today with this.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.800
What, was shaving your head the final clincher?

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:44.910
You are half correct.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.930
However, what was <i>
truly</i> necessary is in here.

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:51.310
Your hair?! Gross!

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:52.770
You ignoramus!

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:54.600
You will do <i>this</i> with it!

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:56.030
Cut it out! That's really gro—!

00:03:57.030 --> 00:03:59.240
It's... a wig?

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:05.720
I thought your disguise would seem suspicious if all you did was clothe yourself like a girl.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:09.260
So you got the vice president mad at you on purpose?

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:15.050
A shaved head or two is a small price to pay for my Three Kingdoms figurines.

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:17.460
I'm sorry, Gakuto.

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.510
It is yet too soon to weep, Kiyoshi-dono.

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:23.470
Save your tears for the successful
completion of your breakout mission.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:25.900
Yeah. I'm going to do it.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:29.230
I'm gonna break out of here, for sure!

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.710
I need this dry cleaned, please.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:34.450
Okay.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:36.980
Please put your name and grade here.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:41.530
Before your breakout,
you must secure a girl's uniform

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:44.160
from the girls' dorm laundry room.

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:48.010
I can get near the girls' dorm via the drainage shaft,

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:50.910
but the laundry room's service door is locked.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:51.890
Which means...

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:57.130
I'll have to sneak inside when the cleaning service guy is working.

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:59.460
It is an important mission.

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:01.090
Please proceed with great care.

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:02.840
There we go...

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.350
He's working pretty fast.

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:11.140
There's no chance for me to
sneak into the laundry room.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:15.860
Kiyoshi-dono, you have to act quickly, or else he'll finish and leave.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:19.990
Perchance he has no plan to actually get inside.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:24.910
Pops! What are you looking at?!

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:27.530
What? Are you calling <i>me</i> pops?

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:32.120
You were looking at yours truly's head and laughing, weren't you?!

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:34.060
Huh? No I wasn't.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.240
Are you mocking me?!

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:37.180
Enough already, kid.

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:39.120
Don't cower over there,
come on over here!

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:40.880
I already <i>am</i> coming over there!

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:44.620
Get over here already, I say!

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:46.300
Look, I <i>am</i> getting over there!

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:49.100
Yo! Yo! Yours truly is the most valorous man in Nerima!

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:51.180
Pops, I sneer at your reckless mockery!

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:53.140
I am altogether pissed!
I return your diss!

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:55.170
Yo! Yo! Yo! Yo!

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:58.270
Yeah! Yo! Gozaru! Gozaru!
Goza-goza-gozaru!

00:05:58.270 --> 00:05:59.860
I'm fiercely perturbed, and swooning!

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:01.780
Yours truly will show you what's in him!

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:03.700
Take one more step, and I'll let loose with pee-pee!

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:05.450
Could these be...?

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.780
Yeah, these are without a doubt the vice president's!

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:08.620
There's no way they're not!

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:11.330
Have you still yet to finish, Kiyoshi-dono?!

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.480
Panties with this much intricate lace have to be...

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:17.330
Hey, you! Gozaru!
Goza-goza-gozaru! Yo!

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.460
Gakuto, what are you doing?!

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:22.980
I'm sorry, mister!
Please cut him a break!

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.560
I <i>am</i> the one who deserves a break!

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:29.800
What's wrong with you all of a sudden?

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:32.960
You just got your head shaved last night to get off the hook!

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:35.600
Unhand me! Hey, hold it, you!

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:38.190
Stop it, you idiot!
What if the vice president sees you?!

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:40.270
For Pete's sake,

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:43.210
what was with that kid?

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:45.900
Kiyoshi-dono, hurry!

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:48.770
Yours truly can offer
you no further support!

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:54.430
That's the last of them.

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:57.420
Oh, no!

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:04.470
Where'd Kiyoshi go?

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:06.880
Get out of the truck, quickly!

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.550
If you get caught outside of school grounds,

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:13.260
the breakout plan will be a bust!

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:17.720
Additionally, we will all have our
sentences lengthened by a month!

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:21.490
It's all over!

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:26.570
What was that? Did I run over something?!

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:32.990
Hey, hey, who the hell left this outside?!

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:34.240
A laundry basket?

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:36.540
You must have set
that up ahead of time!

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:43.970
You gave me quite a scare.

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:45.760
That was a close one.

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:50.390
You know, Kiyoshi-dono, placing the basket there was uncharacteristically nice thinking from you.

00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:51.850
Same to you.

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:54.350
Luring the cleaning guy away like that really saved—

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:57.610
Really saved me.

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:00.290
That was naught but
duck soup for yours truly.

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:06.550
As shown by yesterday's events,

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:10.070
I believe that the prisoners are starting to become defiant.

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:12.320
Is this a result of poor
supervision on your part?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:15.780
They have grown accustomed to the harsh environment of the prison.

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:17.450
Their will to live rivals that of a cockroach.

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:19.910
I do not wish to hear excuses.

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:25.920
I-I think...

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:30.690
I should reinforce the disciplinary tactics I employ while overseeing the prisoners, starting tomorrow.

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:31.680
Would that be all right?

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.650
Please do so.

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:43.270
But if they commit another scandalous act...

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:51.440
You understand what will happen to you, don't you?

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:53.440
Y-Yes.

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:58.850
It'll be more easygoing
than usual tomorrow,

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:00.500
since we'll be helping
out with the track meet.

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:01.870
Bare legs.

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:05.380
At last, on the morrow, the
Guan Yu and Red Hare figurines,

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:08.840
which are only available once
every four years, will be mine.

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:10.290
I don't need any girl.

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:12.800
Not as long as I have my figurines!

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:15.760
The wrestler to watch at tomorrow's student sumo matches

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:18.720
is Tanaka-kun, a 4th-year at Ryogoku University.

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:19.940
Mm-hmm...

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:22.190
Once he gets his left arm in, he has nothing to fear.

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:23.580
Oh, yeah?

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.220
Mayumi, are you listening to me?

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:27.150
Yeah, I'm listening, I'm listening.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:29.690
Tomorrow's the day—

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:32.110
The greatest challenge of my life.

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:34.510
Chiyo-chan, I swear,

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.570
I will successfully break out of here.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:54.220
To the gate!

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:01.080
Today is the track club's regional meet.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.230
Kiyoshi and Dirty Four-eyes will be watching bags.

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:05.100
The other three will be doing miscellaneous jobs.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.130
Yes!

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:10.980
Whoo! The other schools'
uniforms are nice and fresh.

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:15.090
How great would it be
to be a starting block!

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:18.320
Hurry up and change into your exhibitionist uniforms, sluts.

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:20.920
Who gave you permission to speak?!

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:25.960
First, let's go over today's plan.

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:28.200
When the 12:00 bell rings,

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:31.340
Kiyoshi-dono, you will take the bag
with yours truly's specially-made wig,

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:32.750
and head for the lavatory.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:33.400
Yeah.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:34.920
Excuse me!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.180
Would you keep an eye on this for me?

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.220
I acknowledge receipt, miss.

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:41.980
Please be sure to mind anything valuable yourselves, okay?

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:43.890
Right. Here you go.

00:10:44.150 --> 00:10:45.760
Why were they dressed like that?

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:47.650
Didn't that funny
talking guy have a boner?

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:53.110
Okay, let's continue our assessment.

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:56.230
Be sure not to forget the speaker.

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:58.070
You had it stuffed <i>there</i>?

00:10:58.070 --> 00:11:00.700
Once you enter the
lavatory, place the speaker,

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.210
get out through the rear window, and into the drainage shaft.

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:08.540
Proceed along the drainage shaft
to the trash area, and don the wig.

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:11.040
Then change into the hidden uniform...

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.920
...and walk boldly out the front gate.

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:16.110
You will then watch the sumo matches, followed by purchasing my figurines.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.300
After you board the 2:00 train and return,

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:19.670
we will have been successful.

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:21.430
It's almost time.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:25.600
Are you making lunch?

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:27.310
Oh, Mayumi!

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:30.130
I thought we could eat them while watching the sumo matches.

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:31.110
Aren't you making too many?

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:34.130
He is a boy, after all. They eat a lot, right?

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:36.650
Huh? Wait, you're going
together with Kiyoshi-kun?

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:39.410
What are you talking about?
I told you that already, didn't I?

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:42.580
No, no, but that was before the boys got incarcerated, right?

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.500
He said he got permission to leave.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:47.100
Still, a date with a boy...

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:49.370
It's not really that big of a deal.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:54.950
Eating box lunches while looking at shapely asses is a grand time.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:55.800
Yeah.

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:58.080
These last three weeks...

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.590
They've seemed so long, yet so short.

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:01.420
Yeah.

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:04.970
I never imagined I'd become such good friends with you.

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:08.060
Ultimately, it's all for
the sake of my figurines.

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:09.690
Yeah, I know.

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:16.780
It's time.

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:18.930
I entrust it all to you now, soldier.

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:20.360
Sally forth to victory!

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:22.640
I'm off.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:26.160
Why?!

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:15.690
Hmm?

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:19.110
Hair?

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:21.590
I feel like I've seen these cuticles before...

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:22.970
Dirty Four-eyes!

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:27.510
Damn, this is hard with the buttons all backwards.

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:35.810
Crap! There's nowhere to hide!

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:38.900
I'll just have to finish dressing and head for the gate fast!

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:39.820
Huh?!

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:41.530
It doesn't fit!

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:45.360
Damn it! I've got to hurry!

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.700
If I run away now,

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:57.260
she'll definitely see and call out to me!

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:10.680
It's just one of our school's students.

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:17.060
That was close!

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.980
I'm starting to get nervous.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:23.530
After all, this is my first time.

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:26.050
Student sumo matches...

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.370
I'd get cold feet if I
went to watch them alone,

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:30.490
so I'm really grateful to Kiyoshi-kun.

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:35.450
This is the first time I'll be watching sumo matches with a boy, too.

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:36.960
It's a date, all right.

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:38.790
No it isn't.

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:40.190
We're just fellow sumo spectators.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.130
I wish Mayumi hadn't said anything.

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:45.420
I wonder if Kiyoshi-kun
has left the school yet.

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:47.510
Chiyo-chan,

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:50.470
I will soon be at Ryogoku,
where you're waiting for me!

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:53.240
Should I just cut right through there?

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:54.480
If anyone spots me...

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:59.160
I'll zoom past Gakuto's spot as the biggest pervert in school!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:01.460
No, don't lose your nerve!

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:03.930
I can do this!

00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:05.240
I am a girl!

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:07.770
The finest girl at this school!

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:09.100
I can do this.

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.900
Just five more meters!

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:12.540
Just one more meter!

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:21.150
Just a moment.

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:23.460
Why are you dressed like that?

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:28.930
Don't wear your bag on your back.

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:29.730
It's unbecoming.

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:30.590
The bag?

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:33.450
You mean, she hasn't realized who I am?

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.100
I'm sorry.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:45.260
You were hiding the fact that your blazer is ripped, weren't you?

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:47.610
I'm sorry if I embarrassed you.

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:48.810
Go ahead.

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:52.510
I did it.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.290
I did it!

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:06.500
Success!

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.600
Chiyo-chan, sit tight!

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:10.440
I'll be right there!

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.640
Hey, Dirty Four-eyes,

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:18.640
are you keeping close
watch over these bags?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:21.100
Yes. I'm making sure to
be a true gentleman—

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:23.980
I don't see Kiyoshi here.

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:27.230
Kiyoshi-dono has gone to the lavatory.

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:29.520
It seems his piles have gotten no better.

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:32.200
My goodness, what are
we to do about him?

00:16:33.690 --> 00:16:34.330
You...

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:35.330
Yes?

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:39.490
What is the meaning of this?

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:41.590
Wah! I'm terribly sorry!

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:43.540
What a faux pas!

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:47.630
So it's not just your bunghole that's loose, but your fly as well?!

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:50.320
That guy who talks funny had a rod stuck between his legs.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.590
Did he seriously crap himself? Gross.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:04.620
Hey there.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:06.150
Chiyo-chan!

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.400
Sorry, I'm a little late.

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:10.220
I just got here, too.

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:11.980
Never mind that, though, you're sweating.

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:14.160
Ah... Yeah, I ran here
from the train station.

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:15.570
Here.

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:16.120
Are you sure?

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:17.080
I'm sure.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:19.560
I brought it just for you, Kiyoshi-kun.

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:20.790
"Thank you very much."

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:26.420
Whoo, it smells great!

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:27.580
Let's hurry on in!

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:29.180
They've already started!

00:17:29.180 --> 00:17:32.840
A sumo date is... the best!

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:42.310
There might be a future yokozuna here.

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:43.760
It's so exciting!

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:44.750
You're right.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.610
This really is incredible.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.880
Honestly, I'm not interested at all.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:49.820
But...

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:53.680
watching Chiyo-chan watch the sumo matches is fantastic!

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:54.270
Oh yeah.

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:55.700
Kiyoshi-kun, have you had lunch?

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:57.260
Huh? Lunch?

00:17:57.260 --> 00:17:58.660
I ate that box lunch
before I sneaked out.

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.040
I made us some lunch.

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:02.150
I haven't eaten yet.

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:03.160
Actually, I'm famished.

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:04.690
Thank goodness!

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:06.180
Don't be shy, help yourself.

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.380
Huh? Just onigiri?

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:08.990
Wow, those look good.

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:09.970
I have tea, too.

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:12.460
Well, Chiyo-chan made these onigiri.

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:15.300
I feel like I could eat a ton of them, whether they're plum, salmon, kelp, or whatever.

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:17.040
Thank you for the food!

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:24.210
Mm, even just salted, these onigiri are delicious!

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:25.270
Thank goodness!

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:27.290
I made them all just salted.

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.730
Huh? Nothing but carbohydrates?

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.910
Is Kiyoshi <i>still</i> using the toilet?

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:33.990
Ah, yes—

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:36.880
I don't care how bad his hemorrhoids are, he's been away from his post for too long.

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:37.450
Absolutely.

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:40.950
Yours truly warned
him about that already.

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:42.920
Vice President, I shall go and convey—

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:45.670
No. I'll go warn him myself.

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:46.370
Huh?

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:50.610
Kiyoshi!

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:53.080
Keep your bathroom breaks to a minimum!

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.050
Answer me!

00:18:56.050 --> 00:18:59.890
What is the meaning
of not answering me?!

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:09.280
Answer me by <i>crapping</i>, will he?!

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:12.240
Kiyoshi-dono requires considerable time to move his bowels.

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:13.120
Shut up!

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.860
Do not leave your post!

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:23.270
It somehow worked.

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:27.330
Yours truly's episode of incontinence... it wasn't for naught.

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:30.190
That boy who talks funny got hit, and now he's laughing.

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:31.790
What a nasty creep.

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:34.510
They all look so strong.

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:39.470
Kiyoshi-kun, just a second!

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:41.050
Let me take a picture of you!

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:43.360
You have rice stuck to your
cheek and the tip of your nose!

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:45.430
I've never seen you
so candidly! It's adorable!

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:47.390
Let me take a picture
together with you!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:49.350
She's close...

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:51.310
She's close, she's close, she's close!

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:54.570
Wow, it's almost like we're lovers!

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:56.280
This must be what bliss is!

00:19:57.610 --> 00:20:00.060
Sorry, Chiyo-chan,
I need to use the restroom!

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:01.610
Mm-hmm, go ahead.

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:07.830
Oh, no!

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:10.180
It would be bad if his phone or something was in there!

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:20.080
I hope she texts me that picture of us together once I get released.

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:24.760
Our faces were so close, she might even let me hold her hand when I get back.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:31.980
Why...?

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:36.860
Wow, there was a student sumo wrestler in the bathroom, too.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:39.860
Seeing him up close,
they really are big, huh?

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:43.620
Disgusting...

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:44.780
Huh?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.370
You're disgusting.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.330
I'm disgusting?

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:53.830
For using the restroom?

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:12.270
You're disgusting! You're disgusting! You're disgusting!

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:15.520
One more hour.

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:19.310
I wonder if Kiyoshi-dono has purchased my figurines yet.

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:28.410
Sure looks easy to
be a baggage clerk, huh?

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:31.870
You're the one who opted for
miscellaneous jobs detail, Shingo-dono.

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:35.650
You know something, I haven't seen Kiyoshi around in a while.

00:21:35.650 --> 00:21:37.730
Kiyoshi-dono is in the lavatory.

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:39.740
His piles appear to be getting worse.

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:41.850
You sure he's not just slacking off?

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:42.840
I'll go have a look.

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:46.500
Speaking to someone using the
facilities is impolite, Shingo-dono!

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:50.070
What are you two doing?!

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:52.500
Kiyoshi's slacking off!

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:54.230
I told you, he's using the facilities!

00:21:54.230 --> 00:21:55.840
Hey, Kiyoshi!

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:56.940
Come out here immediately!

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.860
I haven't seen your
face since before noon!

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:06.540
If you won't come out... then I'm going in.

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:11.670
The boys' release date is coming up next week...

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:12.770
right?

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:16.520
It is, but knowing those
impure, foolish boys,

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:19.990
once they get out of prison,
they're sure to pull something else.

00:22:19.990 --> 00:22:21.130
Don't say that.

00:22:21.130 --> 00:22:24.350
They have endured the Underground Student Council's strict mentoring for a while now.

00:22:24.350 --> 00:22:26.610
I am sure they are
plenty sorry for what they...

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:27.010
did!

00:22:28.540 --> 00:22:30.270
Excuse me, I have a text.

00:22:31.630 --> 00:22:33.980
I won't ask again, Kiyoshi.

00:22:34.480 --> 00:22:36.160
Come out of there, immediately.

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:40.300
You there!

00:22:40.300 --> 00:22:42.570
Do <i>not</i> touch yourself at a time like this!

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:43.490
I have an itch!

00:22:44.570 --> 00:22:46.280
What is going on here?!

00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:49.240
At the very end, my defecation sound is not playing!

00:22:49.650 --> 00:22:51.310
No answer?

00:22:52.160 --> 00:22:53.450
In that case...

00:22:56.430 --> 00:22:58.490
I'll just do <i>this</i>!

00:24:35.060 --> 00:24:38.060
Next time on Prison School:
